        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Off-Set Decorative Shower Handles Pair</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 6-3/16\" decorative off-set shower handles are solid brass construction allowing for years of durable continuous use. Available in 8 different finish colors to match your bathrooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SD-OP620-size.gif?v=1704354716\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Off-Set Decorative Shower Handle Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Off-Set Decorative Shower Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4-3/16\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Off-Set: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with decorative handles and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (handles hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 handles - 1 handle for each side of the glass)</b>\r\n</p>",
